osen weren't lost to the chaos of the universe? For Jun Sakurada, just such an opportunity is presented to him in his darkest hour: a chance to communicate with a future version of himself who did not win the key and bring forth the Rozen Maidens, and a chance to fix the shattered remains of his own world.<br>\n<br>\nFor Jun-who-did-not-win, the messages from his younger self represent a beacon of light in his mediocre and disappointing existence. When the adult Jun discovers a box with parts and building instructions for a familiar red-dressed doll, the goal becomes clear: revive Shinku in his world to save both worlds from succumbing to the evils of Kirakisho, the seventh Rozen Maiden in a desperate search for a body and master. The Alice Game will become a war of dimensions as two worlds hang by the threads of fate.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":27,"month":9,"year":2013},"episodes":13,"externalLinks":[{"language":"Japanese","site":"Official Site","type":"INFO","url":"http://www.tbs.co.jp/anime/rozen/"},{"language":null,"site":"HIDIVE","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.hidive.com/season/19861"},{"language":"Japanese","site":"Twitter","type":"SOCIAL","url":"https://twitter.com/rozen_anime"}],"genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama"],"hashtag":"#ローゼンメイデン","isLicensed":true,"meanScore":71,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":45,"season":null,"type":"RATED","year":2013},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":88,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":2013},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":13,"season":"SUMMER","type":"RATED","year":2013},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":22,"season":"SUMMER","type":"POPULAR","year":2013}],"relations":[["SOURCE",37728,7728,"MANGA","MANGA"],["ALTERNATIVE",64,64,"ANIME","TV"],["ALTERNATIVE",65,65,"ANIME","TV"]],"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2013,"source":"